# Context hygiene, not a per-image filter: one context serves two
# images — Dockerfile.zio (zio-cli) and Dockerfile (the Astro site plus
# docs/book/blog/examples). A pattern here that excludes something one of
# them COPYs makes that image unbuildable, with "not found" pointing at
# the Dockerfile rather than at this file.
#
# So only ballast is listed: build output, caches, VCS metadata and the
# local machine state that must never reach an image.
.git
.gnux
.idea
.vscode
.claude
.agents
.github
dist
**/target
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
.venv
apps/site/.astro
*.pt
